{"ancestors": "0,9013933,9033792", "bizKey": "9033795", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-09-13 21:35:49", "detail": "<p>TEC是高端光模块制冷的核心器件。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/06/09/8204ed91-8442-4333-8ab0-708c5c42c9d9-1686299138906.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 418.00px;height: 374.06px;\"/></p><p><br></p><p>目前的200G、400G和800G光模块，microTEC是必须要使用的，否则无法解决波长稳定性的问题。</p><p><br>MicroTEC价格与器件尺寸和晶粒数量有关，速率越高，价格越贵，</p><p>50G光模块的TEC金额约30元（单个光模块使用2片TEC，单个TEC价格为15元）</p><p>100G约100元（6-8片/15元）</p><p>800G约300-400元（6-8片/40元）</p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "SR", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "散热", "parentId": 9033792, "pctChg": -5.5, "reason": "Micro TEC 是被喻为5G和高端数通光通信光器件精准温控的最优解决方案。", "remark": "", "sort": 8, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9033795, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-09-13 21:35:49"}
